{"id":"00210","root":"uni00210_1","name":{"ja":"イングリッド","en":"Ingrid"},"title":{"ja":"【ビーチの女帝】","en":"【Beach Empress】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【ビーチの女帝】 イングリッド","en":"【Beach Empress】 Ingrid"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Nomad"],"release":"2019-06-30","limited":true,"characterId":10,"profile":{"ja":"エドウィン・ブラックの側近。エドウィン・ブラックの勢力に属する魔界の貴族階級の子弟出身。常に彼に従い、彼の護衛として、優秀な秘書として仕えている。魔界騎士の異名を持つ美女。得物は長剣。斬り裂いた敵を黒い炎で焼き尽くす魔剣術の使い手。エドウィン・ブラックには主と臣下の関係以上の思いを抱いているが、それは胸の奥に秘め、常に献身的。ただしエドウィン・ブラック以外には冷徹な風で接し、朧とは対立している。魔族と呼ばれる魔界では多数を占める種族で、人間と姿は似ているが身体能力は超人的で人間とは比較にならない戦闘能力を有す。夏のある日、配下の者達への慰労としてビーチへ繰り出したイングリッド。彼女を信奉する女魔族達の手によって色気ムンムンの水着が用意されたが、それも余裕で着こなしてみせる。とはいえ、見せたい相手はここにはいない。敬愛するブラック様と一緒に来たかったと、イングリッドは密かにため息を吐くのだった。","en":"Ingrid is a close aide to Edwin Black. Born into the noble class of the Demon Realm that serves Edwin Black's faction, she constantly follows his orders, serving both as his guard and as an excellent secretary. She is a beautiful woman known as the Demon Realm Knight, wielding a longsword and mastering a demonic sword technique that incinerates slashed foes with black flames. While she harbors feelings for Edwin Black that go beyond a master-servant relationship, she keeps them hidden and remains devoted. However, she treats everyone except Edwin Black with a cold, ruthless demeanor and is at odds with Oboro. In the Demon Realm, demons are a numerous race that resemble humans but possess superhuman physical abilities and combat prowess incomparable to humans. One summer day, Ingrid took her subordinates to the beach as a morale boost. Female demons who worship her prepared a sultry swimsuit, which she wore with ease. Still, the person she truly wanted to see wasn't there; she let out a secret sigh, wishing she could have been with her beloved Black."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"榊木春乃","forms":[{"id":"uni00210_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1176,2352],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[184,368],"def":[124,2